  "id": "section-684",
  "title": "送给李讷的四句话",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-064.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>064)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　1．天将降大任于斯人也，必先苦其心志，劳其筋骨，饿其体肤，空乏其身，行拂乱其所为，所以动心忍性，增益其所不能。2．彻底的唯物主义者是无所畏惧的。3．道路是曲折的，前途是光明的。4．在命运的前头痛击下头破血流但仍不回头。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/1-063.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-065.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
